k secrets, state-affiliated media reported.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Exiled leader Sheikh Hasina plans to return to Bangladesh on Dec. 16</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:faa2e990965153f7cb7cdef56a762391086e600fdfc3a5f479c4423badb2fe9f</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:08:11Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T07:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/exiled-leader-sheikh-hasina-plans-to-return-to-bangladesh-on-dec-16/a-80028083--b9b8951e810c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/exiled-leader-sheikh-hasina-plans-to-return-to-bangladesh-on-dec-16/a-80028083?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After two years of exile in India, ousted Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina has set a return date to Bangladesh. She was sentenced to death in absentia last year over a brutal crackdown that left hundreds dead.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US adds Megaspeed, at center of Nvidia scandal, to a trade blacklist</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:360e40ce32c49f2ca25a0822cf350769652686877402b53ff968c1e70fd5b801</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:08:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T22:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-adds-megaspeed-at-center-of-nvidia-scandal-to-a-trade-blacklist/a-80026849--f5370c0bb019.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-adds-megaspeed-at-center-of-nvidia-scandal-to-a-trade-blacklist/a-80026849?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Trump administration has added Megaspeed to a trade blacklist after tensions over its failure to do so raised questions. The news came the same day that Jensen Huang was reinstated as Nvidia's CEO.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tajikistan follows US call, withdraws from ICC</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ddbdeb423f62d078085230b8d9dade83c3f0bcf370edbe173b6558295d33f4e</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:07:29Z</up